    "content": "<section class=\"page-hero faculty-detail-hero\" style=\"background-image:url('assets/kechuang-xilou.jpg')\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"index.html\"><span data-lang-zh>首页</span><span data-lang-en>Home</span></a> / <a href=\"faculty.html\"><span data-lang-zh>师资队伍</span><span data-lang-en>Faculty</span></a> / <span data-lang-zh>刘佳彤</span><span data-lang-en>Liu Jiatong</span></div>\n    <h1><span data-lang-zh>刘佳彤</span><span data-lang-en>Liu Jiatong</span></h1>\n    <div class=\"en-line\"><span data-lang-zh>Faculty Profile</span><span data-lang-en>Faculty Profile</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt faculty-detail-section\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <article class=\"teacher-detail-card\">\n      <div class=\"teacher-detail-aside\">\n        <img src=\"assets/faculty-liu-jiatong.png\" alt=\"刘佳彤\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"teacher-detail-copy\">\n<div class=\"breadcrumb-mini\">当前位置：师资队伍 › 教师队伍 › 刘佳彤</div>\n        <a class=\"teacher-detail-back\" href=\"faculty.html\"><span data-lang-zh>返回师资队伍</span><span data-lang-en>Back to Faculty</span></a>\n        <h3>刘佳彤</h3>\n<p class=\"detail-role\"><span data-lang-zh>教师队伍</span><span data-lang-en>Faculty</span></p>\n        <div class=\"detail-paragraphs\">\n              <p><span data-lang-zh>个人学术简介与代表性成果待学院确认后补充。</span><span data-lang-en>Personal academic biography and representative achievements to be added upon college confirmation.</span></p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"cta-band\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div>\n      <h3><span data-lang-zh>希望加入这支团队？</span><span data-lang-en>Interested in joining our team?</span></h3>\n      <p><span data-lang-zh>面向海内外延揽优秀人才。</span><span data-lang-en>We recruit outstanding talent globally.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-ghost-dark\" style=\"border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.7)\" href=\"careers.html\"><span data-lang-zh>查看招聘</span><span data-lang-en>View Careers</span> →</a>\n  </div>\n</section>"
